<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車ブレーキ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車止める.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家玄関夜.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door1_C.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Inside the house, it was pitch dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dad and Mom were at a class reunion and wouldn't be home today.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>, no doubt, was out running around with guys again.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> had probably never thought well of me, fawned over by everyone around me as a genius girl.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even though my parents, for their part, had never treated us sisters differently because of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before I knew it, a wall had formed between us sisters.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "32" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I went into my room on the second floor and picked up my smartphone.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電話呼び出し.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\ファミレス.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "700" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Oh, hello, Mom? Enjoying the reunion?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Erinaaa</STYLE>! How are youuu?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From her voice, Mom seemed to be pretty drunk.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Behind her, I could also hear drunks making a racket.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The class reunion, or whatever it was, looked to be in full swing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yeah, I'm fine. What about Dad?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Wait just a second!"<PG>
―Shortly, I heard a familiar voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina-chaaan</STYLE>? It's Daaad!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He seemed even drunker than Mom.<PG>
"Listen, <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>! <STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE>'re a chosen child! You're a genius! Do your studying riiight and grow up to be a fine adult! <STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="1">Momoko</STYLE> both, you're smart daughters!"<PG>
After that, I kept making agreeing noises at his long, rambling drunk talk, and hung up at a suitable point.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "WAIT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄切.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Good, my parents seemed to be fine.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Where the two of them had gone today was <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="みなかみし">Minakami City</STYLE>, the prefectural capital of Sawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Actually, it had overlapped in my mind with the business trip of <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai's father</STYLE>, and I'd been a little scared.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "48" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\スイッチ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now then, first I'll sort out what I'm going to do from here, and plan the Operation.<PG>
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
First, an investigation of the accident that happened in Central Park long ago.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Next, look into the Megasawa City case in more detail.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
How that links up with this incident: I'll force a connection even if it's a stretch, and test it as a hypothesis.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\検索.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I went online,<BR>
<BR>
“Motoki-cho Central Park accident”<BR>
<BR>
and when I searched with that...<PG>
In the list, there was nothing lined up but the incident from this morning.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I set the period to yesterday and before, and tried searching again.<PG>
............ 
{PAUSE ""}
This is it...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Hanami visitor dies in accident in Motoki-cho, Sawa Prefecture.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I clicked it, it was a very small article.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE> 788―exactly 12 years ago today, a hanami visitor died in an accident in Central Park.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Fell from a cherry tree.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Got drunk and went tree climbing or something, maybe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who died was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Motoki-cho resident <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="えいいちろう">Eiichiro</STYLE> Niimura-san (30)
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "BGM" "CLICK"}
<PG>
Niimura...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura, as in...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "残滓念.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
In an instant, I was seized by the feeling of goosebumps rising all over my body.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You're kidding...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Niimura, as in... <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s, father...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Age-wise, too, there's nothing that off about it.<PG>
No, it could very well be someone with the same surname, or a distant relative, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not that rare a surname, after all.<PG>
If I remember right, a local paper is published in Motoki-cho, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can find that, I should be able to learn more detailed information.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\検索.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
“Motoki Daily Central Park accidental death hanami”<BR>
<BR>
I searched again with that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was just one hit.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I took one breath, and when I timidly clicked it―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\新聞.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="8">Just after noon today, Motoki-cho resident </STYLE><STYLE ID="9" RUBY="えいいちろう">Eiichiro</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> Niimura-san (30) accidentally fell from a tree, violently struck his </STYLE><STYLE ID="10" RUBY="けいぶ">neck</STYLE><STYLE ID="8"> on the park's fence, and died.</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">Niimura-san had come for hanami with his family, and is believed to have climbed a cherry tree.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">According to eyewitness testimony, Niimura-san climbed the tree to retrieve a balloon that a hanami visitor's child had caught in the tree.</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">Niimura-san had been drinking together with a friend's family, and it is highly likely that his hand slipped.</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島パソコン.gal" "WAIT" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The article ended there.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With just this, there's no proof that he's <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father, but
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・came with his family
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
・a hanami visitor's child who had a balloon
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
from those points, it narrows things down a lot.<PG>
But, 'a child who had a balloon,' then.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Letting a balloon fly off by mistake means it probably wasn't that big a child.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Say, a kindergartner back then; about high-school age now, maybe?<PG>
And,<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">“to retrieve a balloon that a hanami visitor's child had caught in the tree”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Judging by this wording, it probably wasn't Niimura-san's child.<PG>
But, Niimura-san went out of his way to try to get the balloon back for someone else's child.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A "someone else's child" close enough to him for that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I can't shake the feeling that this victim is <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s father.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And, the child who let this balloon fly away, could it possibly be.<PG>
With a hypothesis, you assume it and push ahead, and if it's wrong, you just correct it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But in this case, if I push ahead like this, everything will probably end up beyond repair.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because there's someone I have to work up the nerve to ask.<PG>
Having come this far, there's only one thing I can do. Ask <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> about it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If <STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE> is this Niimura-san's daughter, I can't rule out the possibility that she's involved in this morning's incident, either.<PG>
If it comes out that I lied to <STYLE ID="7">Senpai</STYLE>, that can't be helped at this point.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there's still something bothering me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\法事イメージ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The accident happened 12 years ago today, on April 8. Today is the anniversary of this Niimura-san's death.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If the two are parent and child, then that means the thirteenth-year memorial service was never held. [TN: A Buddhist memorial held 12 years after a death.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are probably times the date gets moved to fit a weekend, but <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>'s manner had been too normal, in a bad way.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What's more, she'd hidden it, going as far as lying about a transfer overseas.<PG>
If, with the anniversary of Niimura-san's death in mind, this morning's incident was brought about―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Besides, in that Megasawa City case, two people were killed every time.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If two are killed this time too, another incident will happen before today is over.<PG>
The more I think about it, the more I feel <STYLE ID="7">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> is deeply involved, but I know there are more factors that deny it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But contrary to that, a feeling of urgency wells up, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Because before today is over, one more person may be killed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't like thinking about things with intuition or feelings, but...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Speaking of intuition―<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ファミレス.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At noon, when the three of us were about to leave Zahha, <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE> said to me, <STYLE ID="12">"Stay with me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that mean there was some kind of danger?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If danger is closing in on <STYLE ID="11">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>...<PG>
This is no good... I really need to sort things out a little...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's not so much that it's complicated; the things I have to think through are just too close to me, and I can't sort out my feelings.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
